WEBVTT

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:07.730
The distortions show no sign of subsiding anytime soon.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.120
Now then, shouldn't your minds be confused soon?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.410
My head... My head's about to boil over!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.930
Hang in there! Don't get taken away!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:18.780
Sorry, we aren't open yet-

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.200
Wh-Wh-What is this?!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.560
But the shop! My shop!

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.240
It's not <i>your</i> shop.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.120
Wh-What was that?

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.680
I was so scared.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.470
What a man.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.330
It's starting!

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.030
Excuse me, do you mind sharing your table with another customer?

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.240
Not at all.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.980
Thank you very much.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:27.330
Well then, please call me over when you've decided on what you want.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.850
No.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:40.300
No.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.890
You like animals, don't you?

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:52.860
Yes.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:59.040
Man, that really sucked.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:03.320
I wonder where that big thing was going.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.830
What a man he was.

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:10.080
D-Damn it!

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.630
T-Take that!

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.590
Seriously? Out of batteries?

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.590
No! I was so close to clearing it, too!

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.570
Berserker!

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.500
Buy me some batteries right now! Enerloop ones!

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:36.360
Nested between the hills and the sea, Fuyuki City is abound with nature.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:41.610
There is a large castle in the thick forest on the city outskirts.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:45.600
The owner of the castle is Ilyasviel von Einzbern-chan.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.990
She may look small, but she's known as the most powerful Master.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:53.750
She is currently living a quiet life in this castle with her maids.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.420
Got it, Berserker?

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.880
You'll buy me some Enerloop batteries.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:03.130
And this is the Servant who has just been given his first errand, Berserker-kun.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:06.080
Can he really get the shopping done by himself?

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.640
Berserker-kun looks a little worried.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:12.390
Best of luck! I'm sure Ilya is rooting for you!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:16.330
Get the errand done just right and show her how cool you are!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:17.650
Oh?

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.470
And I was wondering who she was. It's Leysritt-san.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:23.400
She's worried about Berserker-kun, so she's following him.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.360
Oh, no!

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.410
It's Gil-kun the pranker!

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:33.500
Being a king and all, I've come to
see how you commoners are doing...

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.170
Gil-kun is just bored.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:39.420
But isn't that an idiot Servant walking
around with a stupid smile on his face?

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.920
I have no need for flesh dolls like him in my city.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:44.680
No.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:45.430
What?!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.680
That won't work on me.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.850
That must be because your divinity is low-

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:55.050
Who is he?

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.940
Oh? Berserker-kun, you completely forgot about your axe.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.750
Are you sure it's okay?

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.000
Leysritt.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.450
What are you doing here?

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:08.070
He did have Leys-san's help,

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:12.310
but Berserker-kun got rid of the obstacle himself in the end.

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.550
What a good boy.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.210
Ahh, it's a dog!

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:25.470
What's the matter with you?!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:29.140
Truth is, Berserker-kun really loves dogs!

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.960
But you don't have time to play with dogs right now.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:35.000
Shouldn't you be buying batteries?

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:36.980
No other way out!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.330
Two hours have passed.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:45.420
Huh? Where's Berserker-kun?

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.520
Ah, there he is!

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.990
There's Berserker-kun!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:53.440
It looks like he's become really good friends with the dog.

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:55.120
Just kill me already.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.960
But what about your errand?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.920
Enerloop!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.880
Looks like Berserker-kun remembered.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.780
Hurry! Ilya-chan's waiting!

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:13.260
What could that be?

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.430
Berserker-kun is hurrying to the store.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.150
You'll trip over if you run that fast, though.

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:25.450
Eh? What? Wa-Wa-Wai-Wai- Ah!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:30.660
See? I told you you'd trip over!

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:33.390
But Berserker-kun won't cry.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:36.660
Ilya-chan would laugh at him if he did.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:40.920
Oh? Lancer-kun seems to have disappeared at some point.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.170
Looks like Berserker-kun lost him when he tripped over.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:47.430
The errand's important, but so is a friend.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:48.760
Better look for him!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.590
Ah, there's Lancer-kun!

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:54.030
Sheesh, where were you?

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:57.680
I'm sure Lancer-kun's also really glad that they met each other again!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:00.510
J-Just kill me once and for all.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:10.070
Berserker-kun went through so much to get to the
electric goods store, but it seems they aren't open today.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:14.330
Ahh, Berserker-kun lost his cool.

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.000
That was delicious, Saber.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.300
Shirou, the curry was good.

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.750
Why?!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:32.670
With the store closed, he can't complete Ilya-chan's errand.

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:35.940
Berserker-kun doesn't know what to do.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.180
Berserker.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:44.560
I dunno what the matter is, but why don't we go home?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.950
It's too bad. Let's give up on the errand and go home.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.740
What was that for?!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.490
Berserker, read the note.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:57.510
No, the other side.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:02.000
Go to the department store if the electric goods store is closed.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.860
That's right! You just need to go to the department store!

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:09.760
Ilya-chan took the trouble to think up some alternatives just in case.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:13.350
Even his friend, Lancer-kun, isn't asking to go home anymore.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:14.890
Let's go to the department store together!

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.510
No! I <i>still</i> want to go home!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.800
Berserker-kun finally reached the department store.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:26.360
Can he find out where they sell batteries here?

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.270
Good! He found it!

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.530
Consumer electric goods are sold at the 10th floor!

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:35.160
I bought a new sewing machine!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.160
Berserk-

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:44.410
Wow, Berserker-kun!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.790
You made it to the 10th floor in one jump!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.290
Now where are the batteries?

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:50.960
There they are!

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:53.970
Berserker-kun finally found them!

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:58.180
Berserker-kun's really excited that he found some batteries!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.060
Berserker?!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:00.970
Shit!

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.340
What the hell are you doing?

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.640
I have no idea!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.210
Wait, wait, wait!

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.740
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.370
Huh?! What's with this unknown Noble Phantasm-

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.300
Amazing, Berserker-kun!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.800
You just need to buy the batteries now.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.090
What? You're going home?

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:49.310
Berserker-kun, you're forgetting something important.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:53.500
You didn't forget about Lancer-kun!

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:57.380
Friends really are important to Berserker-kun.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.080
And what exactly is this?!

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.540
I told you I wanted Enerloop!

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:10.030
Madam, could this be...

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:16.720
Your wish has now been granted.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.200
No, wait!

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:24.470
It's not even Enerloop...

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.700
Next section coming up.

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:42.870
Here I go!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.120
Magic Circuit Fullcount!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:48.160
Heart-leaping Rocket Marble Phantasm!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.000
I see 'em! I can see your Marble Phantasm!

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:57.010
My Marble Phantasm isn't working!

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:02.220
Heh heh! I see through your attack!

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.220
Then I'll just punch you!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:06.080
This hurts even more!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:17.010
The demon Akiha's B-grade talent event is
actually a plan to invade politics and finance?!

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:20.530
Power-hungry dog! I seriously misjudged that bitch!

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.780
And the unexpected ally who appeared then...

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:25.990
Ren, what's that collagen for?!

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.770
Next, on White Moon Princess Phantasmoon:

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:30.500
Take This, Too!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.730
I'll Marble Phantasm your heart next time, too!

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:11.380
This is the real thing.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:13.730
Next episode preview!

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.500
Good morning, everyone.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.600
How do you do? Nice to meet you.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:21.490
I'm your teacher, Taiga Fujimura.

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:23.320
N-Nice to meet you-

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.700
Idiot! Don't rub off the sign of my love!

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:29.340
Go! The answer is Fifty! Eighty! Absolutely!

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:31.260
F-Fifty! Eighty! Absolutely!

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:31.980
Title!

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:33.600
Gimme! Gimme! Come on!

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:34.550
N-Next episode!

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.050
Type Moon Serial TV Novel: Sakura.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.120
Look forward to it!

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:40.090
Enjoy Technolife.
